            "skill_name": "Work of Creation",
            "skill_desc": "\"Embryo of Philosophy\" Sunday has weaknesses of all Types. While \"Embryo of Philosophy\" Sunday is in the \"Im Anfang war die Kraft\" state, it will immediately take action after every action taken by targets and becomes immune to action delay effects caused by targets. When it becomes Weakness Broken, its action is additionally delayed. Moreover, after one stack of its Toughness is Broken, it applies <u>Walk in the Light</u> to targets.",
